1
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:05,800
Hola, amigo! It's been a long time.

2
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:10,200
Gracias for coming on such short notice.

3
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:15,420
My abuela always said, mi casa es su casa.

4
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:20,680
<i>So make yourself at home, okay?</i>

5
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:26,820
Do you want a cerveza? Sí, please.

6
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:33,900
Mira, I know this is not easy for you.

7
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:38,360
But we need to talk about the restaurant.

8
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:43,160
The bank called again this morning.

9
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:49,200
They want the money by
the end of the month.

10
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:54,980
¿Qué pasa? You look worried.

11
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:02,540
<i>I'm fine. I just didn't sleep much last night.</i>

12
00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:06,460
Your brother was here, you know.

13
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:11,440
He said the kitchen needs a new stove.

14
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:17,300
Claro que sí. Everything in there is old.

15
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:23,320
We can't pay for that right now.

16
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:30,100
Then we have to find another way.

17
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:33,900
Maybe we could sell the truck.

18
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:39,120
<i>No way, señor. That truck was my father's.</i>

19
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:44,620
Okay, okay. Forget I said anything.

20
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:51,420
Let's eat first.
We can think about it later.

21
00:02:55,020 --> 00:02:57,840
The tamales are still warm.

22
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:01,400
Did your mother make them?

23
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:06,980
Of course.
She made enough for the whole street.

24
00:03:09,180 --> 00:03:11,940
Tell her I said thank you.

25
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:18,740
<i>Tell her yourself. She's coming over tonight.</i>

26
00:03:22,340 --> 00:03:26,120
Tonight? Ay, Dios mío.
The house is a mess.

27
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:30,220
Relax. She doesn't care about that.

28
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:35,260
She cares about everything, believe me.

29
00:03:37,460 --> 00:03:40,580
Vámonos. We're going to be late.

30
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:46,120
Wait, where are my keys?

31
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:52,900
On the table, next to your phone.

32
00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:56,040
<i>Got them. Let's go.</i>
